  "content": "<div>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kB46TvP.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"112\">這個模組將木筏加入了遊戲。</p>\n<p>你可以使用任意三根原木和一些線來製作木筏，這些漂浮的木材是你《Minecraft》水域的絕佳補充。</p>\n<p>目前共有六種木筏，對應每種原木類型。</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>這個模組是根據 Darkosto 數週以來不斷提出的點子而創作的。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0KFppoR.png\" alt=\"Akliz 合作夥伴\" width=\"320\" height=\"152\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fakliz.net%252fmrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">需要伺服器嗎？使用優惠碼「mrbysco」即可享首月八折優惠。</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>如有疑問，歡迎加入我的 Discord。</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/maPeNBK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/611982123435556884/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"Discord 連結\" width=\"320\" height=\"76\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;<strong>想支持我們嗎？</strong></h2><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Mrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; —Mrbysco</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shynieke\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; —ShyNieke</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
